ve an open  decentralized network naturally people  around the world are going to use it  open systems beat closed systems and so  when you think of it from that  standpoint the united states has a  choice  we can be adversarial and we can be kind  of closed system minded right we could  say hey we're not going to use this  thing because another country may try to  adopt it or use it and and use it to  their benefit  or we can simply say you know what  there's a global game  we're going to go compete we're going to  embrace this and we're going to make  sure that if anyone benefits from  bitcoin in this open system  we benefit more than anybody else and i  think that's the winning strategy here  is it's not to say  oh let's ban our our citizens from using  this let's try to look at this as a  threat  it's to say hey there's a weapon up for  grab let's go use it and we'll be the  winners  because every other country is going to  do that as well so why don't you just go  make sure you benefit more than  everybody else  so if you like this sort of shortcut  from an interview i did click over here  to watch the entire  interview and please don't forget to  subscribe to the channel take care  everybody bye
 

